                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let's continue the photoshoot!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7452003",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "745200301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Give me a second, I'm considering my options."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7452004",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "745200401",
                    "speaker": "Eula",
                    "text": "#Ah, {NICKNAME}. Didn't expect to see you here.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "745200402",
                            "text": "It's been a while, Eula.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "745200404",
                                    "speaker": "Eula",
                                    "text": "A routine patrol, yeah. But as far as I'm concerned, this is a necessary activity that keeps me in fighting shape."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "745200405",
                                    "speaker": "Eula",
                                    "text": "Mondstadt's enjoyed relative peace lately, and there have hardly been any threats worth mustering the Reconnaissance Company for. As a result, everyone's been going a bit soft."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "745200406",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "Work-life balance is a good thing, you know."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "745200407",
                                    "speaker": "Eula",
                                    "text": "You're not wrong, but as Squad Leader, I must keep my combat strength up at all times."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "745200408",
                                    "speaker": "Eula",
                                    "text": "After all, the swords of our enemies are not dulled by peace."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "745200409",
                                    "speaker": "Eula",
                                    "text": "As such, I'm used to finding quiet places to practice my swordsmanship between patrols to make sure I don't get rusty.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "745200410",
                                            "text": "In that case, the time is nigh...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "745200412",
                                                    "speaker": "Eula",
                                                    "text": "Hmm? What an interesting request."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "745200413",
                                                    "speaker": "Eula",
                                                    "text": "Still, I move pretty fast. Are you sure your Kamera can keep up?",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "745200414",
                                                            "text": "No need to change a thing!",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "745200416",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eula",
                                                                    "text": "Confidence — I like it. In that case, I'm going to go at full-tilt."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "745200417",
                                                                    "speaker": "Eula",
                                                                    "text": "Watch closely now. The waves rise and fall in but an instant."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "745200415",
                                                            "text": "I'll keep you in the frame, no problem!"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "745200411",
                                            "text": "Let me take a photo of you!"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "745200403",
                            "text": "Are you on duty?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
